  "interpretation": "A slow latent AR(1) persistence/suitability propensity combined with a faster conditional meadow-condition process is not sufficient, over the frozen grid, to reproduce the Tampa pattern of immediate memory in both state dimensions with robust older-history value only for coarse recorded state.",
